{{block center|<math>\rho\hat{\omega}(dx+dy)=\rho_0\hat{\omega}_0 dx</math>}}
{{block center|or <math>\rho\hat{\omega}(1+dy/dx)=\rho_0\hat{\omega}_0.</math> (29)}}
Substituting from (28) in (27)
